<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica gas prices rise 2 cts/l, diesel down 4 cts.</title>
<headline>SAfrica gas prices rise 2 cts/l, diesel down 4 cts.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Central Energy Fund said on Thursday gasoline prices would rise by two cents per litre and diesel would fall by four cents with effect from April 2.</p>
<p>Illuminating paraffin would fall by nine cents per litre.</p>
</text>
